# This repository deliberately does NOT use Git LFS.
#
# Attachments used to be tracked here with LFS. Because LFS downloads are
# metered against a bandwidth budget that fails closed, exhausting it made
# `git clone` fail during checkout for everyone. Attachments now live in the
# OpenMowerBot-attachments repository as ordinary Git objects, which are not
# metered, and the corpus here stays text-only.
#
# Do not add `filter=lfs` rules. See README.md for how attachments are stored.
